  "decision_conditions": [
    "Reason : 1 - The proposed roof extension by reason of its location on a terrace of properties with an unimpaired roofline, and its detailed design, would be detrimental to the character and appearance of the building, the terrace as a whole and the general streetscene, contrary to the requirements of policy D1 (Design) of the Camden Local Plan 2017. ",
    "Reason : 2 - The applicant has failed to sufficiently demonstrate that the extract flue would not adversely impact on the amenity of future occupiers with regards to noise, vibration and odours, contrary to policies A1 (Managing the impact of development) and A4 (Noise and Vibration) of the Camden Local Plan 2017."
